x-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.753</mn><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div></div>",
